Subject: [PATCH] Compile hardware feature helpers only on supported architectures

Gate hardware-only feature detection and AES/GCM helpers on their consumers'
architectures. Keep the portable arithmetic path and its C ABI export,
spelling the export directly instead of calling the deprecated internal macro.

Base-commit: 6671f7cfbb13f249b571ffa6326275a8596e0ca2

---
